  "test": "published-artifacts-and-permanent-cluster-wide-argocd-upgrade",
  "note": "Checks run after actual crates.io, GitHub and GHCR publication. Public assets and both crates match the reviewed exact-tag bytes. The existing permanent cluster-wide Argo installation upgrades from 0.5.1 through its public Helm chart with built-in image pins, without component overrides. Three fresh placement cases run before and after upgrading on four real mixed-architecture RKE2 nodes. Previous registry bytes remain readable and retained identities remain unchanged. This permanent-install check does not uninstall, downgrade, interrupt controllers or change Nodes; those cases are covered separately by native acceptance and historical mixed-cluster receipts. Consumer workloads created by the smoke test are removed; Images and releases remain. Initial site hashes precede the receipt documentation update. Internal node names and credential material are omitted.",
